  "description": "Visual, no-SQL-required query builder for business users: browse a catalog of SQL Server views/tables, build queries by dragging columns and setting filters/sorts, preview generated SQL, run and export results, with a full audit trail. Ships as an embeddable ASP.NET Core component with its UI built in — call AddQueryBuilderEditor() then app.UseQueryBuilderEditorUI() + app.MapQueryBuilderEditor().",
